    "GROUNDING – The answer claims paid_search outperformed email in conversion and revenue for every segment, but the printed output only shows overall conversion rates (email 0.380, paid_search 0.311) and does not display any segment‑level differences or average revenues. The cited numeric differences are not present in the output.",
